  "description": "1. Designed for Growing Riders (Ages 8+)\nDesigned as a child’s first electric mountain bike, the Prince is built around the way young riders grow and ride. Its kid-focused geometry creates a natural riding posture and a comfortable reach to the controls, helping young riders build confidence, handling skills, and riding control as they develop.\nInspired by professional cross-country mountain bike design, the Prince features a clean triangular frame and balanced geometry. Its durable construction is suitable for forest trails, neighborhood roads, and gravel paths, while the natural riding position helps young riders develop confident handling from an early age.\n3. Lightweight Aluminum-Alloy Frame\nThe Prince uses a high-strength aluminum-alloy frame that combines rigidity, durability, and reduced weight. Compared with a steel frame, the aluminum-alloy construction is approximately 30% lighter, making the bike easier for young riders to steer, handle, and control during everyday rides and light trail use.\n4. Integrated 36V 10Ah Battery System\nThe 36V 10Ah battery is integrated into the frame for a clean, streamlined appearance that stays close to the look of a conventional bicycle. The internal design helps protect the battery from accidental impacts, water, and exposure, while internal cable routing keeps the frame clean and refined.\n5. Smooth, Controlled 250W Motor Assistance\nRated at 250W, the motor delivers smooth and predictable pedal assistance with controlled acceleration. With pedal assist and no throttle-only power, the Prince is designed for neighborhoods, parks, and gentle slopes, helping young riders maintain balance, confidence, and control without sudden acceleration.",
